CUR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1348.00" y="1437.00" width="1152.00" height="18.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c346" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#D8DDE3;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60.00" y="1482.00" width="2440.00" height="1.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c347" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#545B64;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;500 Jest tests / 50 suites (240 conformance) · 31 pytest integration + 7 teardown · 12/12 live-verified on real AWS, re-verified 2026-07-02 · synth clean against AwsSolutionsChecks + NIST80053R5Checks · 24 SECURITY-EXCEPTIONS registered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60.00" y="1494.00" width="2440.00" height="16.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c348" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#879196;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;Account IDs (123456789012, 444444444444, …) are scrubber-safe placeholders — real AWS account IDs are never embedded. scripts/scp-sandbox-soak.sh is untested live; Titan V2 embeddings deferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60.00" y="1516.00" width="2440.00" height="16.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>